I always pictured wumpuses (even way back when there was just The
Wumpus) as squat creatures, about the shape of a huge tortoise.  No
shell, but built close to the ground, with a round head and four
thick, flatfooted legs (kind of like an elephant's in look) coming out
of its sides at about the positions a tortoise's legs come out of its
shell.  Flat teeth, but an extremely powerful jaw.  This is, as far as
I know, not an "official" account of what Wumpuses should look like;
it's just what I always imagined them as.

